                ('Is a protection sleeve used for both proximal and distal interlocking screws?', 'Yes. Protection sleeves are used for all percutaneous interlocking screw insertions regardless of their position along the nail, as soft-tissue wrapping risk from unguided drilling is present at every interlocking site.'),
