                ('What fractures are best suited to Rush pin fixation in veterinary patients?', 'Rush pins are most effective for metaphyseal and diaphyseal fractures of the radius, ulna, tibia and femur in small to medium-breed dogs and cats where the medullary canal diameter accommodates two or more pins.'),
