                ('What size sequence should be used for square nail reaming?', 'Reaming begins with a circular reamer to widen the canal isthmus, followed by the square reamer in sizes 0.5 mm smaller than the nail, then matching nail size to create the final square profile with minimal force on nail impaction.'),
