                ('What happens if the nail rotates slightly after jig attachment and before interlocking?', 'Any nail rotation after jig attachment misaligns the jig guide holes from the nail interlocking holes, causing missed interlocking attempts. The nail must be repositioned and the jig realigned before drilling.'),
